99	  // DECLARATIVE — like a pack's adoption `questions`, its job is to drive the ask
100	  // (adoption interactively, the scheduler by owner issue), not to gate anything
101	  // here. So the only shape asserted is "a list of names"; whether the repo has
102	  // actually configured them is a fact about the repo, answered where the secrets
103	  // bundle is readable, never at author time.
104	  if (decl.required_secrets !== undefined
105	      && !(Array.isArray(decl.required_secrets) && decl.required_secrets.every((s) => typeof s === 'string' && s.trim() !== ''))) {
